From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josip Seketa <josip.seketa@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:04:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 61/64] gdb/remote: record the thread of the initial stop for
 "info program"

"info program" was wrong after connecting to a non-stop target.

diff --git a/gdb/remote.c b/gdb/remote.c
index 2c35ad8c863..70291abebb2 100644
--- a/gdb/remote.c
+++ b/gdb/remote.c
@@ -5182,6 +5182,7 @@ remote_target::print_one_stopped_thread (thread_info *thread)
 
   /* For "info program".  */
   set_last_target_status (this, thread->ptid, ws);
+  update_previous_thread ();
 
   if (ws.kind () == TARGET_WAITKIND_STOPPED)
     {
